        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ভাগ্যক্রমে",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ভাগ্যক্রমে — bhāgyôkrôme — \"luckily; by good luck\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ভাগ্যক্রমে আমরা বাইরে ছিলাম; যদি ভিতরে থাকতাম, তাহলে আহত হতাম। bhāgyôkrôme āmrā bāire chhilām; jôdi bhitôre thāktām, tāhôle āhôtô hôtām. Luckily we were outside; if we had been inside, we would have been hurt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ভাগ্যক্রমে (bhāgyôkrôme) joins ভাগ্য, luck, to Sanskrit krama, 'a step, an order' (Monier-Williams), in the -e form: 'by the steps of luck', luckily."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
